<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS INDOOR CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results from the Swiss</p>
<p>Indoor tennis championships on Thursday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Tommy Haas (Germany) 6-4 2-6 6-3</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Lionel Roux (France) 4-6 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Olivier Delaitre (France) beat Renzo Furlan (Italy) 1-6 6-1 6-2</p>
</text>
